    "\n",
    "- **Mean arm speed** = average of left and right arm average speed.\n",
    "- **Mean leg speed** = average of left and right leg average speed.\n",
    "- **Arm-speed asymmetry** = absolute left-right difference.\n",
    "- **Leg-speed asymmetry** = absolute left-right difference.\n",
    "\n",
    "The bilateral means reduce duplicated information, while the asymmetry variables are retained as optional candidates because uneven movement may become useful later.\n"
   ]
  },
