    "\n",
    "## 12. Choosing the number of clusters\n",
    "\n",
    "Before fixing `k`, we compare several possibilities.\n",
    "\n",
    "Two common diagnostics are:\n",
    "\n",
    "### Inertia\n",
    "The within-cluster squared distance. Lower is better, but it always decreases as `k` increases, so we look for an **elbow** rather than the absolute minimum.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Silhouette score\n",
    "Measures how well each observation fits its own cluster compared with neighbouring clusters.\n",
    "\n",
    "- closer to `1` = well separated,\n",
    "- around `0` = overlapping,\n",
    "- negative = potentially assigned to the wrong cluster.\n",
    "\n",
    "The project can still retain `k=3` when it provides a more meaningful domain interpretation, but the diagnostics show whether that choice is numerically reasonable.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "144a2549",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "# Use the first 3 components as the compact clustering representation.\n",
    "pca3 = PCA(n_components=3, random_state=RANDOM_STATE)\n",
    "X_pca3 = pca3.fit_transform(X_scaled)\n",
    "\n",
    "k_rows = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for k in range(2, 7):\n",
    "    km = KMeans(\n",
    "        n_clusters=k,\n",
    "        n_init=50,\n",
    "        random_state=RANDOM_STATE,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    labels = km.fit_predict(X_pca3)\n",
    "    k_rows.append({\n",
    "        \"k\": k,\n",
    "        \"inertia\": km.inertia_,\n",
    "        \"silhouette_score\": silhouette_score(X_pca3, labels),\n",
    "    })\n",
    "\n",
    "k_diagnostics = pd.DataFrame(k_rows)\n",
    "display(k_diagnostics.round(4))\n",
    "k_diagnostics.to_csv(\n",
    "    OUTPUT_DIR / \"kmeans_k_diagnostics.csv\",\n",
    "    index=False,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
    "ax.plot(k_diagnostics[\"k\"], k_diagnostics[\"inertia\"], marker=\"o\")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"K-means elbow diagnostic\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Number of clusters (k)\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Inertia\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
    "ax.plot(\n",
    "    k_diagnostics[\"k\"],\n",
    "    k_diagnostics[\"silhouette_score\"],\n",
    "    marker=\"o\",\n",
    ")\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"K-means silhouette score by k\")\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Number of clusters (k)\")\n",
    "ax.set_ylabel(\"Silhouette score\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
