    "\n",
    "# Part II — Trial supervised modelling\n",
    "\n",
    "## 16. Why train a classifier on the exploratory cluster?\n",
    "\n",
    "This stage is a **sanity-check**.\n",
    "\n",
    "The question is:\n",
    "\n",
    "> If the six compact behavioural features contain the information used to form the clusters, can ordinary supervised models reproduce those cluster assignments on held-out participants?\n",
    "\n",
    "This checks the modelling pipeline, feature representation and validation procedure.\n",
    "\n",
    "It must **not** be reported as independent flotation-quality prediction because the target was generated from the same feature space.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "620234ba",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## 17. Participant-grouped cross-validation\n",
    "\n",
    "Randomly splitting rows can cause leakage when the same participant appears in more than one trial.\n",
    "\n",
    "We therefore use **StratifiedGroupKFold**:\n",